expression: command.clone().render_long_help().to_string()
---
Create or delete a branch

Usage: specforge git branch <COMMAND>

Commands:
  create  Create a branch at a revision (HEAD when absent)
  delete  Delete a branch: never HEAD's, and one with commits HEAD does not hold only with --force
  help    Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help
          Print help
